WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
<v Interviewer>Tell me about an onboarding case that was harder than it looked.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:19.000
<v Expert>A trading company applied for a business account. On paper it was simple, but the holding company's last filing was three years old, and a family trust owned half of the holding company.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:30.000
<v Expert>The trust deed showed the settlor was also a director of the trading company, so she effectively controlled it through the trust. That makes her a beneficial owner.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:41.000
<v Interviewer>Anything ambiguous in the screening?

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:55.000
<v Expert>One trustee came back as a near match on the sanctions list. Same name, different date of birth. We cleared it, documented why, requested an updated filing and escalated as high risk.
